    "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nWe have updated translations for these services:\r\n\r\nAfaan Oromoo\r\nAfrique\r\nAmharic\r\nArabic\r\nAzeri\r\nGahuza\r\nHausa\r\nIgbo\r\nIndonesian\r\nJapanese\r\nKorean\r\nPashto\r\nPersian\r\nPidgin\r\nPunjabi\r\nSomali\r\nSwahili\r\nThai\r\nTigrinya\r\nUrdu\r\nVietnamese\r\nYoruba\r\n\r\nWe should update Simorgh so that it has all of the Cookie and Privacy banner translations. Note, these translations will be added together with those in https://github.com/bbc/simorgh/issues/3721, in the issues referenced below\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\n- Update the service configs at `src/app/lib/config/services/:service.js`\r\n- Check the Simorgh pages load correctly: localhost urls are here: https://github.com/bbc/simorgh/wiki/Simorgh-Pages \r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n**Testing notes**\r\n[Tester to complete]\r\n\r\nDev insight: Before putting the PR through code review, the full cypress test suite should be run (all page types for all services) with `CYPRESS_SMOKE=false npm run test:e2e`\r\n\r\n- [ ] This feature is expected to need manual testing.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nN/A\r\n",
